{% comment %}
  Adophies — Jewelry page template (formerly the Charm Bar 3D page).

  To use:
    1. Shopify Admin → Online Store → Pages → Add page
    2. Title: "Jewelry"   (URL handle becomes /pages/jewelry)
    3. Theme template dropdown → select "page.jewelry"
    4. Open page in customizer to wire each block's GLB URL + poster.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="page-jewelry">
  {% section 'jewelry-trio' %}

  {%- if page.content != blank -%}
    <div class="page-width text-center" style="padding: 40px 24px 80px;">
      <div class="rte">{{ page.content }}</div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
